  "scope": "Stateless direct dispatch for exactly 82 known AVM1 one-byte opcodes after the original action-count/timeout and function-end guards. Commit the same one-byte reader cursor before invoking each unchanged handler. Unknown bytes, every long action including Call 0x9e, empty input and debug output retain the original Reader, Action match and singleton-Push fallback. No bytecode cache, allocation, GC edge, object field, batching, value/prototype caching or reordered callback is added. Exact frozen v21 dispatcher plus independent Reader and stateful differential fixtures cover route, cursor, error, timeout, reentrancy and whole-movie branch semantics. Compiled code size and unprofiled performance remain unmeasured; this source package claims no runtime qualification or speedup.",
